        <li>Physical DC current-shunt <code class="text-emerald-300">measured_j</code> readings are recorded on AMD Kria KV260 (onboard TI INA260 SOM_5V_DC: 11,428 pJ per gate cycle in Metered Commit Gates; 81.86× sub-bit float unpack tax, 26.58× 4-stage cascade, and 21.61× @ 6a22dee live stream in Downward LUT6 Compilation &amp; Compiled Agency; plus @ a9de8d8 media J/min stages) and NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor (TI INA238 VIN + 3-channel INA3221 VDD_CPU_SOC_MSS/VDD_GPU in Satiation Benchmark Harness, The Communication Tool Avalanche, Downward LUT6 Compilation, Compiled Agency @ 6a22dee, and Planetary Media @ a9de8d8). Stage C programmed an Alchitry Pt V2 (SRAM; energy unmetered on Pt V2). Guide: <a href="/living/fpga-sim/alchitry/#energy" class="text-brand-cyan no-underline hover:text-brand-teal">/living/fpga-sim/alchitry/#energy</a>.</li>
